<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>TaskEarn Nigeria</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f1f5f9;margin:0;color:#172033}
header{background:#087f5b;color:white;padding:22px;text-align:center}
main{max-width:500px;margin:25px auto;padding:15px}
.card{background:white;padding:22px;margin:15px 0;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #ddd}
button{background:#087f5b;color:white;border:0;padding:13px;border-radius:8px;width:100%;font-size:16px}
.task{border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:15px 0}
small{color:#667085}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>TaskEarn Nigeria 🇳🇬</h1>
<p>Complete tasks and track your progress</p>
</header>
<main>
<div class="card">
<h2>Welcome!</h2>
<p>Your task dashboard</p>
<h3>₦0.00</h3>
<small>Demo balance — no real money available yet</small>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h2>Available Tasks</h2>
<div class="task">
<strong>Task 1: Visit a website</strong>
<p>Explore a website and learn something new.</p>
<button onclick="alert('Demo only. No money will be credited.')">View Task</button>
</div>
<div class="task">
<strong>Task 2: Read an article</strong>
<p>Read an article and answer a question.</p>
<button onclick="alert('Demo only. No money will be credited.')">Start Task</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h2>Withdrawals</h2>
<p>Withdrawal requests are not yet connected.</p>
<button onclick="alert('Withdrawal service is not available yet.')">Request Withdrawal</button>
</div>
<footer><small>TaskEarn Nigeria by Fauznoone</small></footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
